+  <p>Permissions: Leaf runs with no network access and no static access to your files. Opening, saving and exporting go through the file-chooser portal, which grants exactly the file you pick, and settings are kept in the app's own directory under <code>~/.var/app/io.github.frandavid100.leaf</code>. If you would rather give it a directory outright, enable it with <code>flatpak override</code>:</p>
+  <ul>
+    <li>Read and write documents in Documents without the portal: <code>flatpak override --user --filesystem=xdg-documents io.github.frandavid100.leaf</code>
+    </li>
+  </ul>
+</description>
